      "side": 1,
      "message": "This motivation is specifically about AI authorship, but we also include any other non-human contributor, such as bots and other automated tools.\n\nFor example, an automated dependency update could reasonably use a bot as its technical Git author, with a human subsequently reviewing and approving the change.\n\nI don\u0027t think that should be prohibited, right?",
